OL,3,GNEWSAGlider damaged after items set on
OL,4,Afire in back of vehicle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Translink glider has been damaged
OL,7,Fafter a number of items on the vehicle
OL,8,Fwere set on fire on Thursday.
OL,10,FThe glider was on Twinbrook Road in
OL,11,Fwest Belfast at around 17:40 BST when a
OL,12,F"young man set fire to a number of
OL,13,Fitems at the back of the bus", police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FNobody was injured during the blaze,
OL,17,Fbut the driver, who extinguished the
OL,18,Ffire, has been left "shaken".
OL,20,FPolice said damage was "caused to the
OL,21,Fflooring", and there was "smoke damage
OL,22,Fnoted throughout".
